  "description": "Levia Dream Drops Tincture delivers 500mg of calming indica relaxation in a convenient dropper format designed for restful evenings and restorative sleep. This tincture from Levia combines precision dosing with fast-acting effects, making it ideal for those seeking deep relaxation and relief from daily stress. The indica classification ensures a soothing, body-focused experience that helps quiet the mind and ease tension. Simply place drops under your tongue for quick absorption and customizable dosing tailored to your needs. Perfect for nighttime use, Dream Drops promotes feelings of calm and sleepiness without overwhelming intensity. Whether you're winding down after a long day or preparing for restful sleep, this 500mg tincture offers a discreet, controlled way to experience the relaxing benefits of indica cannabis. Levia's commitment to quality ensures consistent potency in every drop, helping you achieve the peaceful state you desire.",
